OL,3,GNEWSAPilots of crashed RAF jet thank
OL,4,Aemergency services
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo RAF pilots who ejected out of a jet
OL,7,Fmoments before it crashed and burst
OL,8,Finto flames have thanked emergency
OL,9,Fservices after returning home.
OL,11,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft plummeted to the
OL,12,Fground in Pencarnisiog, Anglesey,
OL,13,Fnarrowly avoiding homes after flying
OL,14,Fout of the nearby RAF Valley station
OL,15,Flast Wednesday.
OL,17,FA trainee and an experienced
OL,18,Fprofessional parachuted out of their
OL,19,Fplane and are expected to make a full
OL,20,Frecovery after being treated for minor
OL,21,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
