OL,3,GNEWSAPilots of crashed RAF jet thank
OL,4,Aemergency services
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pilots thanked those who supported
OL,7,Fthem in the immediate aftermath of the
OL,8,Fincident and are now recuperating, RAF
OL,9,FValley said.
